# Noteworks — Cursor project rules

## Supabase Edge Functions deploy

The Supabase CLI is not global. Always use `npx` from `packages/supabase`:

```bash
# All functions
cd packages/supabase && npx supabase functions deploy

# One function
cd packages/supabase && npx supabase functions deploy <function-name>
```

First time: `npx supabase login` then `npx supabase link --project-ref canhewvuprjwmpopcloj`

More detail: `.cursor/rules/supabase-edge-functions.mdc`
